Subject: Cantor Identity Accounting Journal and Host Protocol P1 Exploded Requirements

& [Custody]
  + IAJ-01 valid initial ledger and exact basket
  + IAJ-02 deterministic contiguous genesis and patch event identities
  + IAJ-03 semantic replay from each predecessor into retained successor
  + IAJ-04 complete closed event and snapshot graph

& [Protocol]
  + IAJ-05 exact journal compare-and-set root
  + IAJ-06 read operations have no successor
  + IAJ-07 complete roster projection or refusal
  + IAJ-08 explicit reference resolution
  + IAJ-09 exact inspection and retained reads
  + IAJ-10 one replayable P0 patch
  + IAJ-11 append-only successor plus preserved history
  + IAJ-12 exact request response result binding

& [PersistenceBoundary]
  + IAJ-13 canonical bounded byte encoding and restore
  + IAJ-14 strict shape digest and semantic replay validation
  + IAJ-15 pure core with caller-owned physical durability and effects
